{"ID":"20240205153645-kfpej3i","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153645-kfpej3i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153645-kfpej3i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171238-usvfuw8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164043-64um41y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171238-usvfuw8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:150,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:150\u0026#125;","title":"白附子","type":"doc","updated":"20240902115451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205171238-usvfuw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171238-usvfuw8","updated":"20240205171431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【來源】\t天南星科植物獨角蓮Typhonium giganteum Engl.的乾燥塊莖。\n【產地】\t主產甘肅、河南、湖北等地。\n【性狀】\t白附子塊莖呈橢圓形或卵圓形，長25cm，直徑13cm。表面白色或黃白色，有環紋及鬚根痕，頂端具莖痕或芽痕。質堅硬，斷面類白色，富粉性。無臭，味淡，嚼之麻辣刺舌。\n【性味】\t味辛、甘，性溫，有毒。\n【功效】\t燥濕化痰，祛風止痙，解毒散結止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240205171258-uo21caa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171258-uo21caa","updated":"20240205171258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171258-noilzt8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164043-64um41y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164043-64um41y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹白附"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹白附-20240205164039-0eff4kr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717165913-bhsqg24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717165913-bhsqg24","updated":"20240717170619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 1-20240717170222-ss2nkv3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 396px;","style":"width: 386px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 3-20240717170619-2rmlqy1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 386px;\" parent-style=\"width: 396px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718085434-uyi4pzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085434-uyi4pzk","updated":"20240718085437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 6-20240718085433-2w9luq4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 5-20240717190416-7rnv1cj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718090144-ptn6wxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718090144-ptn6wxi","updated":"20240718090855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 13-20240718090359-j34fa46.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 10-20240718090144-zrf5v60.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240718090852-ywpojdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718090852-ywpojdf","updated":"20240718090905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 456px;","style":"width: 446px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 14-20240718090851-9whk0il.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 446px;\" parent-style=\"width: 456px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 407px;","style":"width: 397px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 12-20240718090257-qtx6wnc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 397px;\" parent-style=\"width: 407px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717170658-0c90lqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717170658-0c90lqh","updated":"20240717190307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 853px;","style":"width: 843px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 4-20240717170658-loekflw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 843px;\" parent-style=\"width: 853px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 432px;","style":"width: 422px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 11-20240718090209-g4tijkh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 422px;\" parent-style=\"width: 432px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718090212-u9x40p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718090212-u9x40p0","updated":"20240718090212"}},{"ID":"20240718085611-p10p0gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085611-p10p0gk","updated":"20240718085617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"芋头和独角莲叶子对比"}]},{"ID":"20240718085644-km1ky93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085644-km1ky93","updated":"20240718085647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"独角莲叶子"}]},{"ID":"20240718085716-7j3ulq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085716-7j3ulq0","updated":"20240718085957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 8-20240718085957-nga0vt1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独角莲 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独角莲 7-20240718085902-t6ltqkj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718085618-ar2pfoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085618-ar2pfoc","updated":"20240718085642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"芋头叶子"}]},{"ID":"20240718085755-ba328pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718085755-ba328pq","updated":"20240718085807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 662px;","style":"width: 652px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芋头"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芋头-20240718085716-mkq4f3t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 652px;\" parent-style=\"width: 662px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 336px;","style":"width: 326px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芋头 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芋头 1-20240718085807-alow6nr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 326px;\" parent-style=\"width: 336px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717170234-oelhmw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717170234-oelhmw6","updated":"20240718090435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：白附子为独角莲的地下块状茎，有毒，可用生姜解。"}]},{"ID":"20240717170235-jtyhhue","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717170235-jtyhhue"}},{"ID":"20240902115443-bh3zs7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-bh3zs7z","updated":"20240902115451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：白附子"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-7kgsbmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-7kgsbmd","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白附子《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-rvvljnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-rvvljnk","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】BáiFùZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-2bi4vxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-2bi4vxw","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RHIZOMATYPHONII"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-5v1kvp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-5v1kvp7","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】禹白附子、独角莲、独脚莲、牛奶白附、鸡心白附、疔毒豆、麻芋子、雷振子"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-qo54c8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-qo54c8q","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为天南星科植物独角莲TyphoniumgiganteumEngl.的干燥块茎。秋季采挖，除去须根及外皮，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-fchhvcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-fchhvcf","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈椭圆形或卵圆形，长2～5cm，直径1～3cm。表面白色至黄白色，略粗糙，有环纹及须根痕，顶端有茎痕或芽痕。质坚硬，断面白色，粉性。无臭，味淡、麻辣刺舌。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-11cke9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-11cke9b","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品横切面：木栓细胞有时残存。内皮层不明显。薄壁组织中散有大型黏液腔，外侧较大，常环状排列，向中心渐小而少，黏液细胞随处可见，内含草酸钙针晶束。维管束散列，外韧型及周木型。薄壁细胞含众多淀粉粒。粉末黄白色。淀粉粒甚多，单粒球形或类球形，直径2～29μm，脐点点状、裂缝状或人字状；复粒由2～12分粒组成，以2～4分粒者为多见。草酸钙针晶散在或成束存在于黏液细胞中，针晶长约至97（136）μm，螺纹、环纹导管直径9～45μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-k706e5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-k706e5g","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】生白附子：除去杂质。制白附子取净白附子，分开大小个，浸泡，每日换水2～3次，数日后如起黏沫，换水后加白矾（每100kg白附子，用白矾2kg），泡1日后再进行换水，至口尝微有麻舌感为度，取出。将生姜片、白矾粉置锅内加适量水，煮沸后，倒入白附子共煮至无白心，捞出，除去生姜片，晾至六七成干，切厚片，干燥。每100kg白附子，用生姜、白矾各12.5kg。本品为类圆形或椭圆形厚片，周边淡棕色，切面黄色，角质。味淡，微有麻舌感。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-vj2f3f4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-vj2f3f4","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，温；有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-eohjd3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-eohjd3n","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归胃、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-oq85rbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-oq85rbb","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风痰，定惊搐，解毒散结止痛。用于中风痰壅，口眼歪斜，语言涩謇，痰厥头痛，偏正头痛，喉痹咽痛，破伤风；外治瘰疬痰核，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-fa17xx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-fa17xx3","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】一般炮制后用，3～6g。外用生品适量捣烂，熬膏或研末以酒调敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-jlunnof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-jlunnof","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇慎用。生品内服宜慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-jcvrxyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-jcvrxyg","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-za1cq1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-za1cq1a","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-eccz0rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-eccz0rw","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白附子《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-4s125h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-4s125h5","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】BáiFùZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-9yk01fx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-9yk01fx","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】gianttyphoniumrhizome"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-3yqmpgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-3yqmpgo","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】禹白附、牛奶白附、野半夏、野慈菇、鸡心白附、麻芋子"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-n4d677w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-n4d677w","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-9x9joe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-9x9joe7","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为天南星科植物独角莲的块茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-uob6zt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-uob6zt2","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：TynhoniumgiganteumEngl."}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-stjzazo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-stjzazo","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：带根块茎作种的栽种当年可收获，不带根的要多种1年。冬季倒苗后，挖起块茎，小的作种，大的加工作药。将块茎堆积发酵，使外皮皱缩易脱，装在箩筐里，放在流水里踩去粗皮，晒干。亦有不去粗皮，切成2-3mm厚的薄片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-gwk59ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-gwk59ql","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】独角莲，多年生草本，植株常较高大。地下块茎似芋艿状，卵形至卵状椭圆形，外被暗褐色小鳞片。叶1-7(与年限有关)；叶柄肥大肉质，下部常呈淡粉红色或紫色条斑，长达40cm；叶片三角状卵形、戟状箭形或卵状宽椭圆形，长10-40cm，宽7-30cm，初发时向内卷曲如角状，后即开展，先端渐尖。花梗自块茎抽出，绿色间有此红色斑块；佛焰苞紫红色，管部圆筒形或长圆状卵形，顶端渐尖而弯曲，檐部卵形，长达15cm；肉穗花序位于佛镂苞内，长约14cm；雌花序和中性花序各长3cm左右；雄花序长约2cm；附属器圆柱形，直立，长约6cm，紫色，不伸出佛焰苞外；雄花金黄色，雄蕊有2花药，药室顶孔开裂；中性花线形，下垂，淡黄色；雌花棕红色。浆果熟时红色。花期6-8月，果期7-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-fr6r7cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-fr6r7cq","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-ij5zmae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-ij5zmae","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于阴湿的林下、山涧、水沟及庄稼地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-pq140pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-pq140pu","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于北纬42度以南、包括西藏南部在内的广大地区。此外，吉林、辽宁、江苏、湖北等地有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-5dvkwzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-5dvkwzs","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-nhjn7sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-nhjn7sw","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜凉爽湿润气候和阴湿的环境。以选肥沃、湿润的砂壤上栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-qcmk993","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-qcmk993","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术以块茎繁殖为主。冬季来收时，选留小块茎作种，用干细泥沙分层堆积，贮藏备用。小块茎有带根和不带根的两种，要分别栽种。5月，在整好的地上，按行距25cm开沟，深6-8cm，每隔6-8cm栽块茎1个，芽嘴朝上，施入厩肥或土杂肥后，盖一层细土。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-jujik15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-jujik15","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理出苗后，及时中耕除草并追肥1次。8月上旬再中耕除草、追肥1次。天旱则及时淋水。不带根的块茎栽2年后才采挖，在冬天倒苗后，结合中耕除草，用厩肥或土杂肥培根，第2年管理同第1年。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-0bywfs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-0bywfs5","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-rd7n57u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-rd7n57u","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别块茎卵圆形或椭圆形，长2－5cm，直径1-3cm，顶端残留茎痕或芽痕。表面白色或淡黄色略平滑，有环纹及点状很痕。质坚硬，断面白色粉质。无臭味淡，麻辣刺舌。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-emrs91g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-emrs91g","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以个大、质坚实、色白、粉性足者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-j9mw0t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-j9mw0t9","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别块茎横切面：木栓细胞有时残存。基本组动外侧有大型粘液腔及粘液细胞，内含草酸钙针晶束，长28－84μm；维管束散列，以外韧型为多见，偶有周木型。薄壁细含有众多淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-e5gw2tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-e5gw2tx","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：类白色。①淀粉粒单粗球形或类球形，直径4-29μm，脐点点状、裂缝状、人字状、十字状、三叉状状或星状，大粒层纹隐约可见；复粒由2-12个分粒组成，有的1个较大分粒与2-4个小分粒复合。②草酸钙针晶散在或成柬存在于类圆形或长圆形粘液细胞中，针晶束长约全116μm。③螺纹及环纹导管，直径9-46μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-lb2gnv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-lb2gnv6","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】块茎含β-谷甾醇(β-sitosterol)，β-谷甾醇-D-葡萄糖甙(β-sitosterol-D-glucoside)，内消旋肌醇(meso-inositol)，胆碱(choline)，尿嘧啶(uracil)，琥珀酸(succinicacid)，酷氨酸(tyrosine)，缬氨酸(valine)，棕榈酸(palmiticacid)，亚油酸(linoleicacid)，油酸(oleicacid)，三亚油酸甘油酯(linolein)，二棕榈酸甘油酯(dipalmitin)。并含白附子凝集素(typhoniumgiganteumlectin)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-yw9qbce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-yw9qbce","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别，薄怪色谱：本品粉末1g，加石油醚(60-90℃)100ml，冷浸一昼夜，吸取上清液30μl点样：以β-谷甾醇作对照。分别点样于同一硅胶G薄板上，以氯仿-甲醇(9.5:0.5)展开，用10%磷钼酸乙醇液喷雾，供试品色谱图中在与对照品色谱相应位置外显相同色斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-1nmt4p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-1nmt4p7","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】生白附子除去杂质。制白附子取净白附子，分开大小个，浸泡，每日换水2-3次，数日后如起粘沫，换水后加白矾（每白附子100mg，用白矾2mg），泡一日后再进行换水，至口尝微有麻舌感为度，取出。将生姜片、白矾粉置锅内加适量水，煮沸后，倒入白附子共煮至无干心，捞出，除去生姜片，晾至六至七成干，切厚片，干燥。每白附子100mg，用生姜、白矾各12.5mg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-4rhqyqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-4rhqyqx","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；甘；性温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-wno2rlx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-wno2rlx","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】胃；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-ko69v21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-ko69v21","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风痰；通经络；解毒镇痛。主中风痰壅；口眼歪斜；偏头痛；破伤风；毒蛇咬伤；瘰疬结核；痈肿"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-jp05u35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-jp05u35","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-6g；研末服0.5-1g，宜炮制后用。外用：适量，捣烂敷；或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-j4trqgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-j4trqgo","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】血虚生风、内热生惊及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-u5grod5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-u5grod5","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于中风痰壅，口眼喎斜，语言涩謇，痰厥头痛，偏正头痛，喉痹咽痛，破伤风症；外治瘰疬痰核，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115443-i4jqxi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115443-i4jqxi5","updated":"20240902115450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902115444-ymn775z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902115444-ymn775z","updated":"20240902115450"}},{"ID":"20240902115446-g6bz1rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115446-g6bz1rm","updated":"20240902115450"}}]}